8. Deployment and Production Support
Maintain code in Git.
Promote notebooks and jobs across Dev, Test, and Prod.
Automate deployments using CI/CD where appropriate.
Monitor failures, performance, and compute costs.
Support production incidents and maintain documentation.
  
