Example of a real project task
Project: Customer and Sales Data Pipeline
Extract customer and sales data from SQL Server.
Load raw customer and sales records into Bronze Delta tables.
Clean customer information and remove duplicate sales records in Silver.
Join customer, product, and sales data.
Create Gold tables for total sales, revenue by region, and customer performance.
Schedule the pipeline to run every day.
Validate source-to-target counts and business totals.
Connect Gold tables to Power BI.
Deploy the code from Dev to Test and Prod.
Monitor pipeline execution and fix production issues.
